## Approach
1. Read .brain/exports/debt.md to enumerate items
2. Read .brain/RETRO.md (latest) and archive DIRECTIVES/retros for context
3. Cross-reference:
   - Sprint 146-150 docker HB spiral → Sprint 151 T-151-014 closure
   - Brain evaluator verification-blind (Sprint 150 T-008/022/028) → Sprint 151 T-151-012 closure
